  <div class="container privacy-policy-content">
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how personal information is collected, used, and protected when you visit igormihajlovski.com, contact me through the website, or subscribe to email updates.</p>
    <p>I respect your privacy and aim to collect only the information necessary to operate this website, communicate with visitors and clients, understand how the website is used, and provide requested services.</p>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-who-i-am">
      <h2 id="privacy-who-i-am">1. Who I Am</h2>
      <p>This website is operated by:</p>
      <address>
        Igor Mihajlovski<br />
        Freelance Webflow Developer<br />
        North Macedonia<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:igor@igormihajlovski.com">igor@igormihajlovski.com</a>
      </address>
      <p>For questions about this Privacy Policy or your personal data, you can contact me using the email address above.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-information-collected">
      <h2 id="privacy-information-collected">2. Information I Collect</h2>
      <p>Depending on how you use this website, I may collect the following types of information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>information you provide through the contact form, such as your name, email address, and message;</li>
        <li>your email address and marketing preferences if you subscribe to email updates;</li>
        <li>technical information generated when you visit the website, such as browser, device, approximate location, IP-related information, pages visited, interactions, and similar usage information;</li>
        <li>technical and security information necessary to protect the website from spam, abuse, and automated traffic.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>I do not intentionally collect sensitive personal information through this website.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-contact-form">
      <h2 id="privacy-contact-form">3. Contact Form</h2>
      <p>When you use the contact form, you provide your name, email address, and message. The form submits this information to the website's server so that I can receive and respond to your enquiry.</p>
      <p>The contact form is used only for communication relating to your enquiry, potential project, service request, or other message you choose to send.</p>
      <p>The website also uses technical anti-spam measures, including a hidden honeypot field and Cloudflare Turnstile.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-newsletter">
      <h2 id="privacy-newsletter">4. Newsletter and Email Marketing</h2>
      <p>If you choose to subscribe to email updates, your email address and marketing consent information are processed using Mailchimp, an email marketing service provided by Intuit.</p>
      <p>Email updates may include information about new projects, demos, tools, articles, services, and other work from Igor Mihajlovski.</p>
      <p>Subscription is voluntary. Where applicable, a double opt-in process is used so that you are asked to confirm your subscription by email.</p>
      <p>You can unsubscribe at any time by using the unsubscribe link included in marketing emails.</p>
      <p>Mailchimp may process and store subscriber information on systems located outside your country. Its processing of personal information is also governed by its own privacy and data protection terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-analytics">
      <h2 id="privacy-analytics">5. Website Analytics</h2>
      <p>I use analytics services to understand how visitors use this website and to improve its content, performance, usability, and user experience.</p>
      <h3>Google Analytics</h3>
      <p>This website uses Google Analytics 4, provided by Google.</p>
      <p>Google Analytics may process information about how visitors interact with the website, including information about pages visited, device and browser characteristics, approximate geographic information, and website interactions.</p>
      <p>Analytics cookies will only be enabled where the required consent has been provided.</p>
      <h3>Microsoft Clarity</h3>
      <p>This website uses Microsoft Clarity to understand how visitors interact with the website and to identify opportunities to improve usability and user experience.</p>
      <p>Clarity may provide aggregated usage information and features such as interaction analysis and session recordings.</p>
      <p>Where consent is required, Clarity's analytics cookies and related tracking will be handled according to the visitor's consent choice.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-cookies">
      <h2 id="privacy-cookies">6. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
      <p>This website may use cookies and similar technologies that are necessary for website functionality, security, and analytics.</p>
      <p>Necessary technologies are used where required for the operation and security of the website.</p>
      <p>Analytics technologies are used to understand website usage and improve the website. These may include Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity.</p>
      <p>Where consent is required, analytics cookies will not be enabled until you choose to accept them.</p>
      <p>You can accept or decline analytics technologies through the website's consent controls and change your choice later through Privacy settings.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-turnstile">
      <h2 id="privacy-turnstile">7. Cloudflare Turnstile</h2>
      <p>The contact form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to help distinguish legitimate visitors from automated or abusive traffic.</p>
      <p>When you interact with a protected form, Cloudflare may process technical information necessary to provide the security service.</p>
      <p>Turnstile is used for website security and spam prevention rather than advertising or marketing purposes.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-hosting">
      <h2 id="privacy-hosting">8. Hosting and Server Data</h2>
      <p>This website is hosted using Hostinger infrastructure.</p>
      <p>Like most hosting providers, the server may automatically process technical information when the website is accessed. This may include IP addresses, timestamps, requested pages or resources, browser information, and other server log information.</p>
      <p>Such information may be processed for website operation, security, troubleshooting, performance monitoring, and prevention of abuse.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-email">
      <h2 id="privacy-email">9. Email Communication</h2>
      <p>Business email communication associated with this website may be handled through the email infrastructure used for the igormihajlovski.com domain.</p>
      <p>If you contact me by email, your email address, message, and any information you voluntarily provide will be processed for the purpose of responding to and managing the communication.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-external-services">
      <h2 id="privacy-external-services">10. External Services and Links</h2>
      <p>This website may contain links to third-party websites and services, including social networks, portfolio projects, and other external resources.</p>
      <p>When you follow an external link, the privacy practices of the destination website apply. I am not responsible for the privacy practices or content of third-party websites.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-data-use">
      <h2 id="privacy-data-use">11. How and Why Personal Data Is Used</h2>
      <p>Personal information may be processed for purposes including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>responding to enquiries and communicating with potential or existing clients;</li>
        <li>providing information or services requested by you;</li>
        <li>sending email updates when you have explicitly subscribed;</li>
        <li>maintaining the security and reliability of the website;</li>
        <li>preventing spam, fraud, abuse, and automated submissions;</li>
        <li>understanding website usage and improving performance and user experience;</li>
        <li>complying with applicable legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Depending on the circumstances, processing may be based on your consent, steps taken at your request before entering into a contract, legitimate interests in operating and securing the website, or compliance with legal obligations.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-data-sharing">
      <h2 id="privacy-data-sharing">12. Data Sharing and Service Providers</h2>
      <p>I do not sell your personal information.</p>
      <p>Personal information may be processed by service providers that support the operation of this website and related services, including providers of:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>website hosting;</li>
        <li>email infrastructure;</li>
        <li>email marketing;</li>
        <li>analytics;</li>
        <li>website security and anti-spam protection.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These providers process information according to their respective services, terms, privacy policies, and applicable data protection obligations.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-international-transfers">
      <h2 id="privacy-international-transfers">13. International Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>Some service providers used by this website operate internationally or may process information in countries other than the country where you are located.</p>
      <p>Where required, providers may rely on appropriate legal mechanisms and safeguards for international transfers of personal data.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-retention">
      <h2 id="privacy-retention">14. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Personal information is retained only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, including communication, business, security, and legal purposes.</p>
      <p>Contact enquiries may be retained for as long as necessary to respond to the enquiry and maintain relevant business records.</p>
      <p>Newsletter information is retained while you remain subscribed or as otherwise necessary to maintain appropriate subscription and consent records.</p>
      <p>Analytics and technical information may be retained according to the retention settings and policies of the relevant service providers.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-rights">
      <h2 id="privacy-rights">15. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on the laws applicable to you, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>request access to your personal information;</li>
        <li>request correction of inaccurate information;</li>
        <li>request deletion of your information;</li>
        <li>request restriction of certain processing;</li>
        <li>object to certain processing;</li>
        <li>withdraw consent where processing is based on consent;</li>
        <li>request data portability where applicable;</li>
        <li>lodge a complaint with an appropriate data protection authority.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise a privacy right relating to information under my control, contact: <a href="mailto:igor@igormihajlovski.com">igor@igormihajlovski.com</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-withdrawal">
      <h2 id="privacy-withdrawal">16. Withdrawing Consent</h2>
      <p>Where processing is based on consent, you may withdraw that consent at any time.</p>
      <p>For email marketing, you can use the unsubscribe link contained in each marketing email.</p>
      <p>For analytics technologies, you can change your choice using the website's Privacy settings control.</p>
      <p>Withdrawal of consent does not affect processing that occurred lawfully before consent was withdrawn.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-security">
      <h2 id="privacy-security">17. Data Security</h2>
      <p>Reasonable technical and organizational measures are used to protect information processed through this website against unauthorized access, misuse, loss, alteration, or disclosure.</p>
      <p>However, no method of transmission or electronic storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="privacy-changes">
      <h2 id="privacy-changes">18. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated when the website, its services, or applicable privacy requirements change.</p>
